DESCRIPTION:Pat O’Neill is a stand-up comedian and weekly regular on the 
 hit comedy podcast and live show  Kill Tony . Originally from Massachusett
 s\, he began his comedy career in Providence\, Rhode Island\, where he was 
 featured at the Rogue Island Comedy Festival and performed at the Comedy Co
 nnection\, including appearances as an opener for Mark Normand.\n\nNow base
 d in Austin\, Texas\, Pat has become a fixture of one of the country’s mo
 st influential comedy scenes. He performs regularly at the Comedy Mothershi
 p and appears weekly on  Kill Tony\,  where his sharp joke-writing\, dist
 inctive perspective\, and consistently strong performances have earned him
   The KT Golden Ticket and  a growing national audience.\n\nWith a rapidl
 y expanding online following and millions of views across social media plat
 forms\, Pat continues to establish himself as one of the most promising ris
 ing voices in stand-up comedy.\n\nCouple's Package includes:\n\n- 2 premium
  seats\n- $90 food & beverage credit ($45 per person)\n- Gratuity\n- Ticket
  Protection\n\nManagement reserves the right to prevent customers from ente
 ring the facility who they deem disruptive or dangerous to other patrons.\n
